OL,3,GNEWSASeafood in recipes 'narrows over
OL,4,Alast century'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe variety of seafood presented to
OL,7,Fpeople in recipes in the UK has
OL,8,F"narrowed" over the last 100 years, new
OL,9,Fresearch shows.
OL,11,FDr Ruth Thurstan, from the University
OL,12,Fof Exeter, studied the range of seafood
OL,13,Frecipes published in Good Housekeeping
OL,14,Fmagazine from 1923 to the present day.
OL,16,FShe found dishes over the years gave
OL,17,Fway to today's "big five" ` cod,
OL,18,Fhaddock, tuna, salmon and prawns `
OL,19,Fwhich now make up about 80% of seafood
OL,20,Featen in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
