OL,3,GNEWSASeafood in recipes 'narrows over
OL,4,Alast century'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Thurston said the results reflected
OL,7,F"decades of interacting changes in fish
OL,8,Fsupply, trade, and supply chains,"
OL,9,Fwhich had shaped what people cooked at
OL,10,Fhome.
